<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>For Khizar</title><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia;color:#66243c;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe0e8,#fff0f3,#ffd2df);text-align:center;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}.card{max-width:700px;width:100%;padding:40px 25px;border-radius:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(150,30,70,.18)}.heart{font-size:62px;animation:beat 1.2s infinite}@keyframes beat{50%{transform:scale(1.2)}}h1{font-size:36px;color:#b52658}button{border:0;border-radius:30px;padding:16px 28px;margin:10px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c52c60,#e9457a);font-size:17px}#secret{display:none;margin-top:25px;padding:20px;background:#fff5f7;border-radius:18px}</style></head><body><div class="card"><div class="heart">💖</div><h1>For My Khizar</h1><p>Mere pyare Khizar,<br><br>Tum meri zindagi ka sab se khubsurat hissa ho. Allah kare hamara pyaar aise hi hamesha salamat rahe. ❤️<br><br><b>Tumhari hi,<br> (Maahi)</b></p><button onclick="document.getElementById('secret').style.display='block';this.style.display='none'">Ek Secret Hai 🤫</button><div id=secret>I Love You So Much Khizar! 💋<br>Hamesha mere hi rehna!</div></div></body></html>
